  doctor [--target DIR] [--root DIR]             FAFF-190/434: install health — each faff skill symlink (live) vs copy (stale) under --target (default the skills install dir), PLUS the merge-fence PreToolUse registration under <--root or findRoot()>/.claude/settings.json (absent/malformed → MISSING, never a crash); exit 1 if any skill is a copy/dangling OR the fence is missing, naming faff hooks-ensure as the fence fix
