  worktree-prune [--own PATH ...] [--branch B] [--issue ID] [--dry-run] [--json] [--root DIR]   FAFF-126: scoped, fail-safe worktree prune — removes ONLY this run's OWN dangling worktree admin dirs (matched by --own path / --branch / --issue), never the repo-wide \`git worktree prune\` that clobbers a live peer; a live peer is protected, a dangling entry of unproven ownership is fail-safe SKIPPED; --selftest runs the table
