  lint-cli-doc [--root DIR] [--json]            FAFF-237: assert docs/guide/cli.md documents every subcommand the CLI dispatches (the COMMANDS registry), bidirectionally — "FAIL docs/guide/cli.md ✗ missing/orphaned: <name>" per drift + exit 1, else "PASS  lint-cli-doc: <N> subcommands documented" + exit 0; exit 2 if the doc is unreadable; --selftest runs the parse/diff table
